side (y=0.30). faceOffsetBelowFretboardTop: Plan-01 side view gives 5.0 mm below the maple neck top + 6.4 mm board (budowagitary plan: 6 + 6.35 mm). Headstock thickness 14.0 mm (Plan-01; budowagitary 13 mm). No truss-rod cover: vintage truss rod adjusts at the heel. Neck depth is an estimate (owner measurements .83-.85\" at 1st, .89-.98\" at 12th). Contour cross-checks: the 1960s drawing front view puts the forearm line within 0.08 cm at the bass edge and 0.58 cm further treble at the tail; its back view puts the belly boundary ~0.67 cm further inboard than the factory 7 3/4\" R arc (factory used). Pickguard bevel line sits ~0.2 cm inside the outline. Registration of the 1960s drawing onto the factory outline: translation only (neck axis on x=0), median 0.46 mm, max 2.1 mm."
